# Blender MTL File: 'Cottage_FREE.blend'
# Material Count: 1
#
# The map_Kd line is the ONLY edit TyraX made to the shipped .mtl, and it is the
# reason this example exists in the shape it does: BLSS's texDetail channel is
# the fraction of a tile covered by a material carrying a texture, and it is
# identically zero over an untextured project - the documented cause of the
# -0.40 dB result a bestiary-trained net scored on examples/procedural. The
# cottage's diffuse is what makes that channel non-zero here.
#
# Kd is 1 1 1 rather than the shipped 0.8: the map modulates it, and 0.8 only
# darkens the texture.

newmtl Cottage_FREE
Ns 225.000000
Ka 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Kd 1.000000 1.000000 1.000000
Ks 0.500000 0.500000 0.500000
Ke 0.0 0.0 0.0
Ni 1.000000
d 1.000000
illum 2
map_Kd Cottage_Clean_Base_Color512.png
